  "reason": "Label-policy change of 2026-11-21 (specs/dsl.md, Start clauses): until, till and til with a bare month, week, quarter or year end the day before the period starts (bM@01, written b), through, thru, ending and 'the end of' stay inclusive. Rows whose label has a u period bound for an until cue are relabeled mechanically (u to b; 'until january 2027' to b2027-01-01). Old synthetic rows whose label ignored a bare-month bound ('every 2 weeks until jan', 'starting marc') get the bound added. Every row of e13 is kept. Not comparable with e13 on the relabeled rows: all engines are rescored.",
